*.sh text eol=lf

# The fixture set is bytes, not text.
#
# Every heartbeat, fault and halt file in it is hashed by the manifest that
# describes it, and several manifests carry the expected hash of a specific
# file. A line-ending conversion on checkout changes those bytes, so the whole
# set would fail in a fresh clone on a platform that converts -- for a reason
# nothing in the failure would point at. Checked out exactly as committed.
tests/fixtures/** -text
